# 0e_temple_hive_hall (layers 3 4) for splinter_splin2.py: the five cable Splinters (the first load forced
# into a Mega with mStateMachine2 and mParticle), their acid sacs popped (Deactivate -> PopSac, the sac
# deletes itself), then every Splinter deleted (DeleteObjectRequest -> ~CSplinter D0).
@f300 god 1; give missile 50; give morphBall 1; give boostBall 1; fastmorph 1
@f302 layer 3; layer 4
@f305 send u0604 Activate; send u0602 Activate; send u048d Activate; send u048a Activate; send u0487 Activate
@f310 tp 92 -345 -105
@f330 send u0604 Alert; send u0602 Alert; send u048d Alert; send u048a Alert; send u0487 Alert
@f340 objs Splinter; objs SplinterAcidSac
@f400 send u0602 Deactivate; send u0604 Deactivate; send u048d Deactivate
@f500 objs Splinter; objs SplinterAcidSac
@f600 send u0604 Delete; send u0602 Delete; send u048d Delete; send u048a Delete; send u0487 Delete
@f700 objs Splinter; objs SplinterAcidSac
